loss_source: machines/mirror_source.machine, and one line more: JOURNAL "/data/journal"
loss_keeper: machines/mirror_keeper.machine, and one line more: JOURNAL "/data/journal"
loss_source: image built (20 expected lines)
loss_keeper: image built (19 expected lines)
=== round 0: each machine booted alone makes its key and publishes the public half ===
enrolled: each device's key, as the line it printed on its own console
=== the fleet: both enrolled, the copy named, each keeping a record ===
fleet: fleet boutique -- 2 members on lan, served by nobody in this fleet -- judged, no refusal
fleet:   mirror ledger_copy -- depot gives /data/ledger to annex, which keeps it in /data/copy and asks every 5 s, in warehouse
fleet:   depot -- mirror_source (mirror_source.machine, 10.30.0.1/24) -- 52:54:00:12:37:01 -- in shop -- enrolled, fingerprint FP1
fleet:   annex -- mirror_keeper (mirror_keeper.machine, 10.30.0.2/24) -- 52:54:00:12:37:02 -- in warehouse -- enrolled, fingerprint FP2
