second: roll: annex -- 3 entries, from its first, in order, each signed by the key enrolled for it (fingerprint FP2); head H3, and no secret took part
second: roll: annex -- every entry is ORDERED and UNDATED: the fleet takes its time from nobody
second: roll: annex -- WROTE 2 entries since the roll of 2026-11-08 09:00 UTC (entries 2-3); ORDERED and UNDATED: nothing dates them
